window.products.push({"id":543034,"name":"8 Pieces Superhero Refrigerator Magnet Diamond Sticker Home Decor Cute Multifunction Magnetic Stickers and Gifts for Home Kitchen Decorationtion (Supe","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81be-49BIBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Attention: The set contains small parts, children under 4 years old should use under adult supervision to avoid eating by mistake. USING STEPS: 1. Cut out the favorite pattern. 2. Tear off the film on the surface. 3. Look at the color number of pattern and find the diamond bag. 4. Pour the diamond in the tray. 5. Use the diamond sticky pen with clay. 6. Glue diamonds to their corresponding color positions. 7. Tear off the diamond sticker, then stick it on the magnetic surface!!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81be-49BIBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SuprCool","source_asin":"B09CD7Z512","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-543034","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09CD7Z512","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09CD7Z512","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":543035,"name":"2020 Mattress Cooler Classic - Chilled Mattress Topper Water Cooling System Ideal for Hot Sleepers and Night Sweats - 27\"x63\"","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":159.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71IIMvllxxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Are you ready for something better than a cooling blanket or a cooling comforter for night sweats? Our bed cooling system will regulate your body temperature and provide you with a better night's sleep. A cooler bed helps you fall asleep faster, decreases insomnia, releases melatonin, and decreases the risk for metabolic elements.How it works:Chilled water circulates through a PVC vinyl mattress cooling pad. The chilled pad removes body heat, cooling you to a desired sleeping temp. After the water has absorbed your body heat, it's returned to the Mattress Cooler and recirculated. Setup:5-10 mins1) Place cooling pad between mattress and a fitted sheet. To cool yourself, place the pad from head to foot. For two people, place across the mattress between your neck and waist. Avoid placement near sharp objects or high friction areas where you get in/out of bed.2) Connect cooling pad tubes to the cooler. Remove the top lid so you can pour up to 2 quarts of water into the Mattress Cooler. The water tank has a water level to prevent overfilling the unit.3) Press \"on\". If you get an E1 error, turn off the cooler, add water, then power on.Cleaning/Maintenance:The system will use about 1 qt of water a night. To preserve your cooler, drain the system every 2 weeks. To drain, remove the drain plug under the unit. You can add up to 1/8 tsp of bleach to the water to keep tubes clean. Don't overuse bleach; it can damage the system.Tips:Place cooler higher than the mattress pad for better circulation. If you are having issues with the water overflowing, first try running it with less water in the tank. If you're still having the issue after, change the fan cycle to D4 when you wake up; it will prevent backflow.Cooling pads should be replaced every 4-6 months, friction will develop weak spots. A replacement pad is included and additional pads are available on Amazon","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71IIMvllxxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MATTRESS COOLER","source_asin":"B07KPMPVLM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-543035","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07KPMPVLM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07KPMPVLM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":543036,"name":"Koi Curtains,Colorful Carp Fish Japanese Symbol Pond Watercolor Painting Asian Exotic Printed Blackout Curtains Window Drapes Treatment for Living Roo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71hnpiyd8xL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"These Unicorn curtains are perfect for Living room, bedroom, kids room, kitchen, yard, patio, parlor, sliding door.-Unique design:· Save energy costs by insulating against heat and cold.· Reduce noises from busy streets and high-traffic areas.· Protect furniture from sun damage and fading.· Provides complete privacy when needed· Perfect for any bedroom, office kids room and living room.-Package Details: Six options1, 2 panels per package, each panel measures 21\" width x 63\" length (53.5cm x 160cm), total size: 42\" W x 63\" L (107cm x 160cm);2. 2 panels per package, each panel measures 27.5\" width x 63\" length (70cm x 160cm), total size: 55\"W x 63\"L (140cm x 160cm);3. 2 panels per package, each panel measures 31.5\" width x 63\" length (80cm x 160cm), total size: 63\"W x 63\"L (160cm x 160cm).4. 2 panels per package, each panel measures 63\" width x 36\" length (160cm x 90cm), total size: 63\"W x 72\"L (160cm x 180cm).5. 2 panels per package, each panel measures 36\" width x 63\" length (90cm x 160cm), total size: 72\"W x 63\"L (180cm x 160cm).6. 2 panels per package, each panel measures 42\" width x 84\" length (105cm x 210cm), total size: 84\"W x 84\"L (210cm x 210cm).-Material:Our Blackout Curtain Liners are crafted from a durable soft and thick triple weaved blackout fabric which can block out sunlight and UV rays. The darker color of the fabric, the more light it can block.-Easy Care Instructions:· Machine washable in cold water· Do not bleach.· Tumble dry on low· Low temperature ironing-Notes:· For your curtains to be more perfect, please choose a size 5-10 Inch larger than the actual window width.· Here may be slight differences in colors on different displays. If you have any questions about the product, please feel free to contact us.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71hnpiyd8xL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Denruny","source_asin":"B09QX76YF7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-543036","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09QX76YF7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09QX76YF7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
