window.products.push({"id":543104,"name":"N'FINITY Wine Rack Kit - 5 Column with Display - Natural Finish - Solid Mahogany","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71LazvwDs2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"N'FINITY. Wine Racks Made Simple. In our effort to create the racking kits you always wanted Wine Enthusiast has developed N'FINITY Wine Racks—a collection many designers say looks even better than custom racking though it is offered at a fraction of the price. This 5-Column Wine Rack Kit holds up to 90 wine bottles from standard Bordeaux size to Pinot Noir and Champagne size. Three 25-bottle tiers. One 15-bottle tier with an angled row for displaying 5 bottles. Size: 74'H x 23-1/4'W x 13-1/4'D (Base & crown molding add 1/2' additional to the depth for a total of 13-3/4'.) Solid Mahogany. Solid Value. N'FINITY wine racks offer both the beauty and richness of furniture-grade decor pieces and the lasting durability of a quality wine storage system. Solid Mahogany makes it possible. Choose from a hand-applied Natural Finish or Dark Walnut Stain. Clear coated. Finished look. Simpler assembly. Hidden pre-drilled fasteners make assembly easier leaving no unsightly screws or holes in the most visible areas. No nail gun or putty needed. Base and crown moldings (included) provide a more finished 'custom' look. Assembly instructions and hardware included. Rubber mallet Phillips screwdriver and nail gun (not included) required for assembly. Nail gun needed only to apply optional face trim. FREE Consultation Assembly time varies depending on the racking kit you purchase and how handy you are putting items together. Need help? Call our Wine Storage Consultants at 800.377.3330 for a FREE consultation. FREE Computer Design Want to create a wine cellar with N'FINITY Wine Racks? Send us a preliminary wine cellar sketch via email or fax. Then call us. We'll design your wine cellar—a $99 value—for FREE! Email:FloorPlans@WineEnthusiast.net Fax: 866.873.2510 Call: 800.377.3330","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71LazvwDs2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"N FINITY","source_asin":"B004CJFQG8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-543104","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B004CJFQG8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B004CJFQG8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
