window.products.push({"id":543119,"name":"100Pcs Disposable Tea Filter Bags 2.65 x 2.95 Inches Natural Tea Infuser Unbleached Material Drawstring Round Tea Bag Empty Tes Bags for Loose Leaf Te","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":6.59,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61lRouGSnoL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Drawstring Empty Bag for Loose Leaf Tea（100 Pcs） - 100% natural unbleached paper.  - 100% not affect the tea taste.  - Perfect for single cup, travel mug, glass, or small pots etc.  Natural wood pulp filter paper, unbleached, burlywood color. Great used for tea, coffee, herbs, scented tea, herbal tea DIY, herbal medicine package, foot bath package, hot pot package, soup package, clean air bamboo charcoal bag, sachet bag, camphor ball storage, desiccant storage, etc. An adventure in a tea bag, you can let your taste buds do the travelling and experience the exotic and wonderful world of Higher Tea ❤. Tea Filter Bags Specifications: Size: 2.95 x 2.67 inch (W x H) Color:Wood color Warm Tips: -Tea filter bags need to be stored in a cool and dry place. Package includes: 100Pcs Tea Filter Bags","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61lRouGSnoL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Staruby","source_asin":"B07ZJBJ1P1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-543119","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07ZJBJ1P1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07ZJBJ1P1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":543120,"name":"Paula Deen Signature Porcelain 12-Piece Cookware Set","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41R3-o7yrUL._AC_.jpg","description":"Enjoy the effortless food release and easy cleanup you get from nonstick cookware at an affordable price with this 12-piece set of the pans you'll use the most in your kitchen from venerable Southern cook Paula Deen. This cookware set includes 1-, 2- and 2-3/4-quart saucepans (each with a lid), a 6-quart stockpot with lid, and 8- and 10-inch skillets. It also comes with a slotted turner and slotted spoon. In addition to a nonstick interior, which allows for easy food release, these pans feature a speckled porcelain enamel exterior that's stain resistant and a breeze to clean up. The pans also feature aluminum construction that evenly and quickly distributes heat and dual-riveted rubberized handles for a cool, comfortable and nonslip grip. The handles are also outfitted with a copper-plated ring for convenient hanging. The tempered-glass lids lock in moisture, nutrients, and flavors while also allowing you to easily monitor the cooking progress. And they're complemented by a copper-plated knob for a kick of Southern style. Finally, the included heat-resistant slotted turner and spoon aid in stirring, flipping, and serving your culinary creations. The pans are oven-safe to 350 degrees F. Hand washing is recommended. Paula Deen got her start with a lunchtime catering business in Savannah, Georgia called The Bag Lady before opening her successful restaurant, The Lady & Sons. And now she spreads her distinctive and authentic Southern delicacies--from real Southern fried chicken and hoecakes to Krispy Kreme bread pudding--via the Food Network and several best-selling cookbooks.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41R3-o7yrUL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Paula Deen","source_asin":"B001CXAD92","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-543120","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B001CXAD92","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B001CXAD92","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
