window.products.push({"id":543193,"name":"Milton Cuisine 13.5L hot Pot, Insulated Casserole, Keep Warm Serving Bowl","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61oRkowN3jL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"These casseroles are odorless, hygienic, durable, and virtually unbreakable. These double walled casseroles are Insulated with TUF-PUF, the world's best insulating material which guarantees a high thermal rating ensures temperature maintenance for hours. These pots come with a high grade stainless steel interior which makes it easy to clean and preserves the temperature and flavor of food. Ideal for stews, meat balls, chili, fruit salads, rice, dal, Chapatti, puree, idli, wada, sambar, Chicken curry etc. Great for transporting food to parties, picnics, and potlucks! The patented locking lid keeps food fresh and spill proof. A convenient and elegant way to bring special dishes to your favorite places. Milton Casseroles come in vibrant colors and attractive designs that you will want to place them right on the serving table! Attractive Casserole Insulated with PU Foam to keep food cool or warm for up to 6 hours Hygienic and odorless, durable strong resistant outer case made from food grade virgin plastic and stainless steel inner liner Unique and attractive shape with easy to carry handles These casseroles can also be used as a curd maker, as Ice packs to store ice cream, custard etc… Ideal for everyday use, parties and picnic with protective looking lids for safe transportation.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61oRkowN3jL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MILTON","source_asin":"B079C5VXVX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-543193","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B079C5VXVX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B079C5VXVX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":543194,"name":"DaaleelaB Black Instax Mini Frame Polaroid Picture Frames with Elegant Moon Motif, Aesthetic Moon Decor 2x3 Picture Frame for Fujifilm & Polaroid Film","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81GSJSc3-6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Enthralling Gothic Decor Tailored for Your Unorthodox Taste - Recognize the allure of the shadowy depths? Let's conjure up a bewitching, moon-lit atmosphere with our Instax mini polaroid frame. Its obsidian finish and cryptic moon symbol can transform your favored snapshot into an enchanting spectacle. Celebrate Your Memorable Moments in High Gothic Style - Cherish your treasured moments using our sophisticated 2x3 picture frames, the perfect companions for your Instax Mini 12, 11, 9, or 7/ Pringo 231/ SP 1/ Polaroid PIC-300P/ Polaroid Z2300/ LG PD 233/ LG PD 239 cameras/ HP Sprocket Photo Printer. Seamlessly slide your precious instant photos into this attractive polaroid frame, elevating your polaroid display. The Quintessential Gothic Gift - Birthed from the heart of shadows, our bewitching frame echoes the spirit of Halloween and witchy decor. It's the perfect tribute to those in your life with a flair for the mysterious, offering them a goth decor home accent that turns heads and provokes intrigue, whether it adorns a home, office, or desk. Hassle-free Photo Switching - Transforming the face of your goth office decor is as effortless as the flutter of a bat's wing. Simply pop the front frame off, swap the photo, and you're done. Experience the versatility of our polaroid frame that doubles as a captivating gothic decor ornament, designed for both wall hanging and table standing displays. Embrace the Enduring Beauty of the Night - Our mini picture frames, draped in elegant black, are crafted from sustainable, 3D printed plant starch plastic. This eco-conscious choice boasts a hardy, durable build, assuring your mini photo frame will continue to cast its enchanting spell for years. The naturally occurring layers of our 3D printed design add an extra dash of mystery and uniqueness to these tiny picture frames.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81GSJSc3-6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DaaleelaB","source_asin":"B097T791D6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-543194","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B097T791D6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B097T791D6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
