window.products.push({"id":543207,"name":"Espresso Machine, Coffee Machine Programmable Buttons for Espresso and Lungo, Compatible with Nespresso Capsules, Italian 20 Bar High Pressure Pump, 3","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/3177jtvA6QL._AC_.jpg","description":"The espresso machine use a high-pressure, 20-bar extraction system to release the full aroma and flavor of each capsule. The high pressure also helps ensure proper water distribution through the ground coffee for consistently delicious cups.Plus,the water tank are easily removable and simply cleaning,You don’t need to grind any beans or clean up any mess like you do with a traditional espresso machine. Our espresso coffee machine compatible with nespresso originalline capsules. You simply insert a capsule and push a few buttons to make a delicious dose of caffeine by our capsule coffee maker. The nespresso machine original is equipped with special coffee foam system, you’ll get perfect foam every time, which any espresso lover will appreciate. Nespresso machine original offers two coffee sizes with buttons for Espresso and Lungo, pre-heat water for 50 seconds so you can be sipping quickly. And its water tank holds 34Oz water, so you won’t have to refill it again and again when you’re serving guests with this nespresso maker. This one-touch espresso capsules machine is equipped with automatic shut-off that turns the machine off if it hasn’t been used for 9 minutes, it is a great safety feature if you forget to turn off the machine before running out the door in the morning. And the espresso maker includes overheating function, it provides additional safety. What ‘s more, comes with capsule tray, it hold up 18pcs capsule that means you don't have to cleanup in every time use. We are committed to serving customers with reliable quality products and 1-Year warranty. Please feel free to let us know if you have any request (product quality problems, packaging problems), we will solve your problem within 24 hours!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/3177jtvA6QL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Grenifer","source_asin":"B09V4W6986","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-543207","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09V4W6986","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09V4W6986","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":543208,"name":"Mcffaga Stainless Steel Flour Sifter for Baking - 4 Cup","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":8.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/514cZ0kCkWL._AC_.jpg","description":"Stainless Steel Flour Sifter for Baking 4 Cup Perfect Flour Sieve, Comfortable to Hold, Use and Clean, to Enjoy The most important step in the preparation of pancakes, cakes, etc is the sieving of the flour! This process filters out excess pearls to expand the consistency by breaking the lumps and increases the air content in the flour. This allows it to mix better with the egg liquid and the final product will be perfect cooking! Large Capacity & Highly Functional It's a Flour sifter 4 cup capacity so that the flour does not overflow from the cup, keeping the work surface clean and tidy, it adopts double-layer rotating sheet to fully break up the flour and filter more gently Top-Quality & Perfect as a Gift Our flour sifter it's made of high-quality stainless steel 430, mirror polished design, sturdy texture, high temperature resistant and corrosion resistant This is the perfect gift for wives, parents, grandparents, and bakers Specification Dimension: 7,6x5,1x5,1 inches Weight: 0,55 pounds capacity: 4 Cups","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/514cZ0kCkWL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mcffaga","source_asin":"B09TTDHG6K","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-543208","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09TTDHG6K","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09TTDHG6K","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":543209,"name":"Deco 79 Wood Anchor Wall Decor with Twisted Rope, 15\" x 1\" x 27\", Blue","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":31.5,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61iffhAe-HL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This wall decor will look amazing in any coastal style inspired space when displayed on blank walls with matching decor. This item ships in 1 carton. Designed with a white jute rope wrapped around the sculpture’s body. Wood wall decor makes a great gift for any occasion. Can be hung vertically using the hole on the back; nails and screws not included. Suitable for indoor use only. This is a single wall decor. Coastal style.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61iffhAe-HL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Deco 79","source_asin":"B07FQXBYTS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-543209","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07FQXBYTS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07FQXBYTS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":543210,"name":"Rubber-Cal Recycled Floor Mat","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91aypHJ6l9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Rubber-Cal's Recycled Rubber Flooring Mat is available in 2 gauges: a 1/4-inch thick and a 3/8-inch thick and is perfect for a variety of applications that require a reasonably priced product Being that this material is made of 100-Percent recycled rubber, this mat is an ecologically responsible product. This product is excellent for either indoor or outdoor applications due the high contents of EPDM (i.e. a UV/Ozone resistant elastomer) found in the recycled tire rubber. Recycled rubber floors are a superior material when trying to reduce noise, contain vibration, and absorb shock from workout equipment. This product is specifically manufactured for durability and is designed for either residential or commercial applications that are exposed to heavy foot traffic. This rubber mat can be used as a workout mat, flooring for home gym, patio mats, as a garage mat, flooring in basement game rooms, or even livestock trailer flooring. Each mat is fabricated from thousands of rubber granules and offers superior underfoot comfort and support along with the resilience to cushion the shock of running, exercising, walking and standing. One of the biggest concerns commonly associated with rubber matting is the installation. This mat weighs roughly 50lbs. in a 4ft x 10ft roll and generally stays down under its own weight; therefore there is no for permanent adhesives. In order to keep the edges and entry points from being a trip hazard, double-sided carpet tape can be used for a uniform and level installation. Recycled Rolled Rubber Mat matting is available in 8 different lengths allowing you to dimensionally match almost any room to help create a safe and warm environment to inhabit.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91aypHJ6l9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Rubber-Cal","source_asin":"B00A48YTXM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-543210","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00A48YTXM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00A48YTXM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
