window.products.push({"id":543320,"name":"EcoRise Dark Bronze Metal Wall Star – Barn Star, Metal Stars for Outside or Inside, Texas Star, Art Rustic Vintage Western Country Farmhouse Iron Wall","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.97,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61WjcPt3R4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Looking for the perfect rustic decoration? These EcoRise barn stars are meticulously handcrafted from iron and make for a perfect home decoration! Is any assembly required? How do the stars attach to the wall? Simply place a nail or screw into the wall and hang the stars using the welded hook on the back of the star. What material is it made of? These barn stars are made of heavy-duty iron that is much stronger than flimsy tin stars and other cheap metals sold by competitors. Can I hang these stars outside? Do the stars rust? The stars are highly durable and have no problem with outdoor conditions. The stars are treated with a special powder coating, giving the star a vintage and rustic look, while protecting the star from rust and wear.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61WjcPt3R4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"EcoRise","source_asin":"B089QW8VXC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-543320","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B089QW8VXC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B089QW8VXC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":543321,"name":"Hummingbird Glass Straws Clear 9\" x 7 mm Long Reusable Straw Designed for Yeti and Starbucks Style Tumblers Made Wth Pride in USA - 4 Pack With Cleani","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71oQgDR5GGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Why Hummingbird Glass Straws Are The Best Durable Non-toxic Environmentally Friendly Can be Used in Hot or Cold Drinks Safe for Kids Shatter Proof Protect Teeth from Cavities and Stains Affordable Dishwasher Safe Easy and Safe to Carry with You Everywhere! Fully Guaranteed Handmade in the USA What To Expect From Your Hummingbird Glass Straw Order You will receive one beautifully designed package containing 4 quality bent Hummingbird Glass Straws. Plus you'll get a cleaning brush! (No, they're not hard to clean, you can pop them in the dishwasher; the brush is just in case you get something stuck). These straws are 9 inches long x 7 mm in diameter, which is perfect for juice, coffee, and teas. These 9 inch straws will fit in most stumblers, including Starbucks cups. The glass is perfectly clear, and both ends are smooth and rounded so they're comfortable to use. Everyone is Joining the Glass Straw Movement! Glass straws have long been popular with environmentalists, but now celebrities like Oprah and Ralph Lauren spokesmodel (and health nut) Valentina Zelyaeva are joining the cause! With the focus on health-destroying plastic toxins and rampant environmental pollution, glass straws aren't just a trend — they're a health and wellness movement that's here to stay. Handmade in the U.S.A. Each Hummingbird Glass Straw is handmade in our studio. These are not cheap, assembly-line glass straws other companies sell, they're the real deal. Every straw is inspected by hand for quality. Don't contribute to pollution and risk your health by using plastic straws-get a Hummingbird Glass Straw 4-pack today!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71oQgDR5GGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hummingbird Glass Straws","source_asin":"B014V83AQM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-543321","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B014V83AQM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B014V83AQM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
