window.products.push({"id":543385,"name":"Komorebi Kid's Wearable Blanket Hoodie Sweatshirt,Oversized Sherpa Comfy Blanket Flannel with Pockets Blanket Hoodie","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":21.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71YfrC-sTcL._AC_UL1500_.jpg","description":"Flannel,fleece Imported Pull-On closure Machine Wash HIGH QUALITY:Are you still afraid of the cold of winter? Do not be afraid!Our comfy kid's wearable blanket hoodie is made of high quality cozy flannel fabric and sherpa lining.We stitched the flannel and sherpa layers into a new composite fabric to ensure the comfort and warmth of the wearing blanket. UNIQUE DESIGN:The giant children wearable blanket hoodie is the latest design and full of fun. The loose long sleeves and elastic cuffs keep children free from clothing restrictions, and the two front pockets can hold small items and keep the palms in the pockets for warmth in winter. There are also a variety of cute, bright color styles to choose from. PERFECT GIFT：The plush wearable blanket for kids is the best gift of Children's Day,Thanksgiving, Birthday, Halloween, Christmas,New Year your family or friends to show your love for them.This hoodie blanket will give them boundless warmth and love. FITS FOR ALL ACTIVITIES:This children blanket sweatshirt is perfect for teens,boys and girls.Kids can wear it easily.This wearable blanket is perfect for watching TV program, play video games, or work on a laptop. You can also wear it when camping, traveling ,participating in sports events or outdoor barbecue and other outdoor activities. EASY CARE:The kid's wearable blankets can be washed by machine,cold water on gentle cycle,tumble dry at low temperature. After cleaning, the wearable blankets will be super soft.There is a litlle tip:Because of the long time compression and transportation, we suggest that you can wash and dry it after receiving the wearable blanket, which will become very fluffy and soft as before.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71YfrC-sTcL._AC_UL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KOMOREBI","source_asin":"B0BD7SNL2K","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-543385","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BD7SNL2K","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BD7SNL2K","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
