window.products.push({"id":543413,"name":"RNK Shops Baseball Jersey Toothbrush Holder (Personalized)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61I9Do-7N2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Transform the look of your bathroom with one of our toothbrush holders! These personalized toothbrush holders will add a charming splash of subtle decor to your bathroom, but when customized with bright patterns and colors, they can easily serve as an accent piece for your bathroom space. Customize a few for yourself, or put your childrens names and favorite animals to make the perfect kids' toothbrush holder! Not to mention, the fun designs and unique personalization make it easy to keep toothbrushes separate, and they might serve as a fun incentive to get your little ones to brush their teeth!These bathroom toothbrush holders are built from acrylic, making them durable enough to withstand daily use. The stand itself is made of three different pieces: an inner cup, a base, and the lid featuring the four holes. Each toothbrush stand has a twist-off lid for easy cleaning and also features 4 holes to accommodate 4 toothbrushes. While designed for toothbrushes, these holders are multifunctional, and can be used for makeup brushes, paintbrushes, and more! Your customization is displayed on the side of this product on a fine-quality, vinyl insert.To clean your toothbrush holder, simply screw off the lid and wipe down with a wet cloth and some mild detergent. Wash the inner piece with some warm water and soap.Design Shown: Baseball Jersey (#474607)Features:==================================== * Built from a durable acrylic  * Features three pieces: base, inner cup, and lid * Screw-on lid with 4 holes to fit 4 toothbrushes * Suitable for toothbrushes, makeup brushes, and more * Customization displayed on high-quality, vinyl inserts * Made for you in the USAInstructions:==================================== * To clean untwist lid and remove inner piece, wash with water, soap, or mild detergent * Wipe down outside with cloth and water or mild detergent","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61I9Do-7N2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"RNK Shops","source_asin":"B01846UOKW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-543413","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01846UOKW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01846UOKW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":543414,"name":"SHIYEL Custom Canvas Prints Personalized Wall Art with Your Photo, Customize Photos Home Decor for Bedroom, Living Room, Wedding Baby Pet Family, Cust","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61pF7XAyDhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Custom Canvas】: Superior Quality Made In Usa, We provides high-quality custom canvas prints. Each canvas art is ready looks vivid. The canvas pictures are made from 1.5 inch thick frame bar for gallery quality profile. Eco-Ink print makes it safety for families and environmental for home environment. 【Customized Souvenir】: Custom canvas print made from your pictures/photos. Create a unique, one of a kind artwork that your friends and family will admire for years to come. Print your own pictures to memory the precious moment in your kids/lovers/pet/animal/view/wedding/family. We combine your best memories captured in photographs with our state of the art technologies and materials to create breathtaking and unique wall decorations. 【Customize Now】: After upload the photo, please make sure stretch the picture to cover the whole canvas area as followed, the stretched picture is the front of the canvas you will get, we will fulfill the border with mirror portrait.Do not leave white border when you stretch the photo. Make sure to upload high resolution picture for high quality print. Low resolution picture will be low quality print. 【Personalized Wall Art】: Print your own pictures to memory every precious moment you with your pets (dog, cat, fish, bird, horse, rabbit, snake, mouse, pig, hedgehog, lizard, etc). Or print some photos of animals you may like (monkey, lion, wolf, owl, fox, tiger, etc). 【Gift】: Awesome gift for Father's Day, Birthday, Mother's Day, Christmas gift and any occasion, or just without any special reason, to show some love to your loved one! He will know you put in the extra effort to find something better than a regular gift! As decoration for living room, bedroom, bathroom, dining room, kitchen etc or a perfect gift for the person you cherish.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61pF7XAyDhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SHIYEL","source_asin":"B09S3HWGP7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-543414","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09S3HWGP7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09S3HWGP7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
