window.products.push({"id":543424,"name":"Sleepwish 3D Purple Dream Catchers Feather Bedding Set 3 Pieces Bohemian Quilt Duvet Cover Hand Drawn Watercolor Art Bedding Gifts (King)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":49.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81a4HqlN9eL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"IMPORTANT NOTE: NO STUFFING INSIDE the duvet cover(not include any comforter or filling) you can put your own comforter, duvet or blanket into the cover, just COVER. Twin size: 1 Duvet Cover (68\" x86\") and 2 Pillowcase (20\" x 26\"). No Comforter in Set.Full size: 1 Duvet Cover (80\" x 90\") and 2 Pillowcases (20\" x 26\"). No Comforter in Set.Queen size: 1 Duvet Cover (90\" x 90\") and 2 Pillowcases (20\" x 36\"). No Comforter in Set.king size: 1 Duvet Cover (104\" x 90\") and 2 Pillowcases (20\" x 36\"). No Comforter in Set.DUVET COVER: A duvet cover is a protective layer that slips over the duvet and has a closure. Because duvets and comforters can be expensive and difficult to clean, duvet covers are useful because they protect your comforter during use and are easily removed and easy to wash.You can also quickly and easily change the look of your bed and room without having to completely redecorate.The duvet cover also allows you to change your style or color of your bedding with the simple switch of the cover.HOW TO USE THE DUVET COVER: 1) Lay the comforter flat. 2) Insert your hands inside and find the two top corners. holding one corner in each hand. 3) With your hands inside the duvet cover, reach down to grab hold of the comforter’s top two corners. 4) Holding the top two corners tightly, give it a shake and a fluff until the duvet cover falls down to cover most of the comforter. 5) Stuff the bottom two corners of the comforter inside the bottom two corners of the duvet cover. zip it up at last!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81a4HqlN9eL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sleepwish","source_asin":"B07X342TFV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-543424","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07X342TFV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07X342TFV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":543425,"name":"ArtSocket 4 Pcs Shower Curtain Set Christmas Night Scene Santa Claus with Non-Slip Rugs Toilet Lid Cover and Bath Mat Bathroom Decor Set 72\" x 72\"","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.9,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71AiZCMJbAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[Premium Bathroom Accessories]: Our shower curtain is made of high-quality polyester fabric, ensuring excellent waterproof performance. The anti-slip bathroom rugs and mats set feature soft, comfortable polyurethane memory foam filling, and a cozy coral velvet microfiber outer material that's skin-friendly, relieving pressure and fatigue on your feet. The non-slip shower carpets and bath rugs are equipped with PVC dots on the bottom to prevent shifting and skidding, ensuring your safety. [The Shower Curtain Set Includes]: The waterproof shower curtain measures 72\"L x 72\"W, while the plush bathroom mat is 23.6\"L x 15.7\"W. The set also includes an o-toilet cover (16.5\"L x 14.6\"W) and a U-shaped rug (17.7\"L x 15.8\"W), all designed to fit most standard-sized bathrooms. [Effortless Installation]: Our bathroom set comes with 12 complimentary, sturdy hooks, making installation a breeze. The shower curtain features 12 reinforced grommets for easy hanging, while the non-slip bath mat and toilet lid cover ensure safety and comfort. [Elevate Your Bathroom Decor]: Thanks to the yellow abstract stylish shower curtain by ArtSocket you can create a relaxing & harmonious bathing atmosphere, while also adding an eye-catching decor piece to your bathroom interior. This stylish 4-piece bathroom set is perfect for your home, motel, hotel, or dormitory.Happy bath times ahead! [Absolutely Easy Care]: For all-time relaxing moments at home! Fully unwind during a lovely bath or shower and enjoy your peace of mind knowing that the Bathroom Sets with Shower Curtain and Rugs are conveniently machine washable in cold water - time-saving and hassle-free, what’s not to love?","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71AiZCMJbAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ArtSocket","source_asin":"B0C4TGLPLW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-543425","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C4TGLPLW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C4TGLPLW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
