window.products.push({"id":543445,"name":"NoCry Premium Disposable 5 Inch Aluminum Pie Pans; Round Foil Baking Tins for Delicious Micro Pies, Individual Crispy Pie Crust, or a Delectably Small","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91gnS-fn5VL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"PREMIUM MINI PIE TINS. The unique ridge design - with the lip curling outward - gives your mini pie crust the support it needs to bake properly. And the precision folds on the sides of each oven safe pan create award-worthy crimping. (They’re freezer safe too!) INEXPENSIVE - BUT TOUGH - SMALL FOIL TINS PERFECT FOR BAKING, SERVING OR STORING. Use these individual tins for home baking, catering, or for freezing ready-to-bake mini crusts. Or get creative and use them as micro cake tins, camping plates, roasting tins, and takeout dishes. (And with 50 stackable pie pans at your disposal, you’ll never run out!) PERFECT FOR THAT 5-INCH PERSONAL PIE RECIPE. All plates have a 5.57 inch outer rim, a 5 inch inner rim, a 3.5 inch base and are 1.5 inches deep. This makes them a great size for making mini Thanksgiving, Christmas, and holiday pies or for bake sales, birthday parties, charity gatherings, large events, catering, or baking for the farmer’s market. BAKE JUST ABOUT ANYTHING. Like an individual chicken or a turkey pot pie. Or a small pumpkin pie. Or a dark chocolate apple pie. Or a cheese and onion quiche. Or a nice apple tart. Or rebel and use these tin pans to make an indulgent personal cake instead. Whatever your baking dreams, these pans have you covered. REUSE OR RECYCLE. Forget about cleaning up glass pie tins after a baking session. Or borrowing extra dishes from the neighbours. Our disposable tins are perfect for the home baker or professional chef. Just use your dish, enjoy the pie, and recycle when done.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91gnS-fn5VL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"NoCry","source_asin":"B09X6BYN1F","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-543445","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09X6BYN1F","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09X6BYN1F","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
