window.products.push({"id":543449,"name":"IMAX 97400-2 Mochrie Lidded Boxes, Set of 2","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71bqBbXIcKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Mochrie Lidded Boxes, Set of Two--The perfect space to stash small treasures from old tickets to jewelry, the Mochrie Lidded Boxes by IMAX are handcrafted of wood. The bases are finished in a neutral stain that highlights the woods natural beauty, while the lids are done in a crisp contrasting white and topped with charming bird finials. We include two boxes in the set, the smaller of the pair measures three 3/4 inches high with a six inch diameter, and the larger measures four 1/4 inches high with an eight inch diameter. Care instructions: Dust with a clean dry cloth. This item has been finished by hand with exemplary detail. There will be slight variations in size, color and texture. These variations are a reflection of the authenticity of the piece and signal the originality of the artisan. Brought to you by IMAX- One source, a world of choices.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71bqBbXIcKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Imax","source_asin":"B00J3JBDBO","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-543449","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00J3JBDBO","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00J3JBDBO","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":543450,"name":"Simax Glass Serving Bowl Set: Borosilicate Glass Oven Safe Bowls - Clear Glass Bowls For Kitchen - Blown Glass Nesting Bowls - Kitchen Mixing Bowls -G","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":32.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81MlvbI1neL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"BEAUTIFUL BLOWN GLASS BOWL: Quality crafted from blown glass, these stunning serving pieces are ones you’ll be proud to show off. They are elegantly thin bowls for kitchen, lightweight while retaining the borosilicate durability. With a set of three bowls, (3.2 cup, 6.4 cup, and 10.8 cup) you’ll be serving all your dishes in style! Perfect for sides dishes, tossed salad, popcorn, candy, and so much more! HEAT AND COLD PROOF WITH A HIGH THERMAL SHOCK RESISTANCE: Pop your bowl in the oven, stick it in the fridge to cool off, and reheat it in the oven...all without shattering the glass. No need to start transferring leftovers to a new container. Simply store this pan this bowl in your refrigerator, and then pop it in the microwave to warm up when you are ready for round two. MADE IN EUROPE: This glass mixing bowl is manufactured in the Czech Republic, so you can rest assured that you will receive a quality product that will last for years. Simax glassware does not absorb odors or flavors, and you do not need to worry about nasty chemicals making their way into your food. Borosilicate glass is 100% Cadmium and Lead free. DISHWASHER SAFE: Cooking is fun. But the mess it creates isn’t quite as exciting. (Anyone have an extra little elf to share?) Well, with this mixing bowl, you don’t have to worry about all that washing up. Simply toss it into the dishwasher and let the machine work its magic. Super simple and super convenient! CONVENIENT STORAGE: Don’t have tons of extra storage space? No worries! These bowls are designed to nest inside each other, so all you need is space for one and you’re good to go. THREE-PIECE SET includes (1) 3.2 cup bowl (measures 6” D x 4” H), (1) 6.4 cup bowl (7.4” D x 5” H), and (1) 10.8 cup bowl (8.8” D x 6” H).","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81MlvbI1neL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SIMAX","source_asin":"B07PFR1SV5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-543450","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07PFR1SV5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07PFR1SV5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":543451,"name":"JIC Gem 1\" Bulk Rough Assorted Materials (Amethyst, 1 Lb)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71DNU5jT9qL._AC_SL1012_.jpg","description":"JIC Gem is proud to present to you our 1 pound average Purple Amethyst Bulk Rough Assortment. Our rough stones are perfect for tumbling and wire wrapping jewelry. Amethyst is a violet variety of quartz and the name comes from the Ancient Greek (\"not\") and (\"intoxicated\"), a reference to the belief that the stone protected its owner from drunkenness. The ancient Greeks and Romans wore amethyst and made drinking vessels of it in the belief that it would prevent intoxication, while medieval European soldiers wore amethyst amulets as protection in battle in the belief that amethysts heal people and keep them cool-headed. Amethyst is a semiprecious stone and is the traditional birthstone for February. The best varieties of Amethysts can be found in Siberia, Sri Lanka, Brazil and the far East. The ideal grade is called \"Deep Siberian\" and has a primary purple hue of around 75-80%, with 15-20% blue and (depending on the light source) red secondary hues. The color of amethyst has been demonstrated to result from substitution by irradiation of trivalent iron (Fe3+) for silicon in the structure, in the presence of trace elements of large ionic radius, and, to a certain extent, the amethyst color can naturally result from displacement of transition elements even if the iron concentration is low. Chakra: Seventh Chakra - Crown or Pineal Gland. Associated Planet: Saturn. Zodiac: Pisces (also Aquarius, Aries, Capricorn).","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71DNU5jT9qL._AC_SL1012_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"JIC Gem","source_asin":"B00M9R10CE","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-543451","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00M9R10CE","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00M9R10CE","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
