window.products.push({"id":543495,"name":"NOVICA Recycled Auto Parts Romantic Metal Sculpture, 4.7\" Tall 'Park Bench Sweethearts'","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":38.8,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81-yViXfe0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"NOVICA, in association with National Geographic, works together with talented artisan designers around the world to produce stunning, keepsake treasures. Our mantra is to spread global happiness, so rest assured - we’ll do everything we possibly can to ensure you’re a happy customer.  About this item: Seated close on a park bench, sweethearts snuggle and talk between quick kisses and shared laughter. Armando Ramírez transforms recycled bicycle and automobile parts into a charming image of rustic appeal.  - Components may vary slightly in size and form - Features a rustic, rugged finish   About our Artist: Born in a Mexican town famed for its traditional artistry, Armando Ramirez dreamed of creating something new. 'As a child I enjoyed inventing toys, and soon yearned to create a unique style of art. Environmentally enamored, I now transform recycled goods. I began to craft figures from scrap and discarded mechanical parts, mostly from cars and bicycles. Thanks to the creativity that God gave me, today I have an enjoyable and better way of life.'","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81-yViXfe0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"NOVICA","source_asin":"B0057Y5MAW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-543495","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0057Y5MAW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0057Y5MAW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
