window.products.push({"id":543609,"name":"Coitak Lion Head Wine Pourer Spout, Wine Bottle Stopper for Home and bar, Animal Wine Pourer and Stopper With Silicone Rubber Fitting","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ZJy7MtxGL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Lion Head Wine Pourer Spout, Wine Bottle Stopper for Home and bar, Animal Wine Pourer and Stopper With Silicone Rubber Fitting by Coitak Unique design, elegant, romantic and practical.  Made of zinc alloy, sturdy and durable, electroplated and polished.  Pouring wine smoothly, not easy to spill, convenient to use. Specifications: Shape: lion head  Process: polishing  Material: zinc alloy and food grade silicone  Color: silver Package Included: 1 * Wine Pourer  1 * Wine Bottle Stopper Warm Tip: Hand washing it with clear water and then made it totally dry in time after every using will ensure a longer lifespan.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ZJy7MtxGL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Coitak","source_asin":"B07XYT328X","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-543609","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07XYT328X","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07XYT328X","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":543610,"name":"2023 Personalized Christmas Tree Ornament for Kids - Super Girl Customized Merry Christmas Ornament - Child Keepsake for Girls Children","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":18.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61CtccLi2BL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The joy of listening to melodious carols while sitting next to the fireplace, and enjoying a hot cup of cocoa simply can’t be put into words. Adding to this merriment are the fairy lights and fresh Christmas decor mixed with old ornaments that fill your heart with love, happiness, and warmth. To make your holidays a little more special, we bring you personalized kids Christmas ornaments that will surely elevate the look of your Christmas tree. Because let’s be real, you can’t really have enough of your kids, can you? And seeing their names on the Christmas tree is the best way to commemorate this wonderful holiday.Multipurpose Use:Our personalized christmas ornaments have multiples uses such as:-Wall hanging-Doorbell ornament-Mantelpiece decoration-Window decoration-Perfect showpiece -Photo frameMake Christmas special for your kidsWhether you have to announce your baby’s arrival or celebrate your kids’ first Christmas, there’s no better way to make this holiday memorable than having our beautifully crafted personalized christmas ornaments decorated in your house.Spread the holiday cheerLooking for a holiday gift that’s uniquely you & stands out? Then our one of kind personalized christmas ornaments would surely do the job. Everyone loves a customized gift that comes straight from the heart. Gift a piece of your heart with our Christmas ornaments, a perfect keepsake & stocking stuffer for your family, friends, relatives, neighbors, and grandparents. Uniquely yoursWith our decorative hanging ornaments, we bring your vision to life. Whether you wish to print a photo or write a beautiful personalized message, we offer an assortment of unique designs & fonts to choose from.How to order?-Click on the “Customize Now” button.-Enter the personalization information in the boxes.-Please double-check the spellings of your customization.-Click on the “Add to cart” button and p","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61CtccLi2BL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Lydia Gifts","source_asin":"B09DFG97DH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-543610","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09DFG97DH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09DFG97DH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":543611,"name":"The Original Teabagger Tea Infuser - Fun Gag Gift for Men and Women for Gifts, Party Favors - Real Tea Ball Made of Food Grade Silicon - Use w/ Loose ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/613m4UTr0EL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"GIVE YOUR AFTERNOON CUPPA A CERTAIN JE NE SAIS QUOI with The Original Teabagger tea infuser! It's just as easy to use as a standard tea ball. The top fits securely into the bottom, with a raised ridge to help the pieces lock together. Holes are just big enough to allow water to flow through without leaves escaping. Hook and chain are made from stainless steel, and long enough to latch onto the rim of your cup or mug, so you can easily dunk your teaballs as often as you like. EASY TO USE AND CLEAN. This is an actual, working tea infuser that can be used to steep loose leaf tea. It's big enough to fit an actual tea bag, as well, for people who like to have a little bit of fun with their daily brew. Won't stain, and easily hand-washes in soapy water with standard dish detergent. No special tools required to clean out the holes. Dishwasher safe on the top rack. IT'LL MAKE YOU GAG with laughter! This fun novelty tea ball is sized for a single cup of tea, and is a perfect gag gift for the tea drinker with an offbeat sense of humor. It fits one teaspoon or one infuser bag. Depending on the length of steep and how strong you like your tea, this can create up to 16 ounces. And best of all--no stray short and curlies to spoil your sipping experience! Measures 2” x 1.25” x 2.75”. DIP THESE BALLS IN HOT WATER. Made from food grade silicone, so it's safe high temperature immersion, and it won't interfere with the flavor of your tea. It is designed to be used in a cup with the hot water poured over it. The Teabagger is a flawlessly designed tea infuser. The classic sac design hints at the shape of twin globes in the base, which gives plenty of room for tea. Avoid boiling directly in a kettle or instant pot. MADE IN CHINA FOR YOUR TEATIME CHINA. Who else but the Chinese can you trust to create the best teatime accessories? Produced in a facility that adheres closely to regulations for food-safe materials. Comes with simple packaging, making it easy to customize how you wrap it. Makes a unique stocking stuffer, funny Secret Santa or holiday office gift, White Elephant or party favor for Bachelorette and Bachelor parties!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/613m4UTr0EL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TEABAGGER","source_asin":"B0745YWVVV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-543611","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0745YWVVV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0745YWVVV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
