window.products.push({"id":543673,"name":"Lodge Cast Iron Baker’s Favorite Set","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":153.22,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81emlBfz+BL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Your search for the perfect cast iron pie pan is over! This traditionally sized pie pan is made for homemade and store-bought crusts alike. It won't dent, bend, or warp at high temperatures. Crafted in America with iron and oil, this pan will help you bake yummy, unforgettable desserts for generations. It provides excellent heat distribution and retention for consistent, even baking. Seasoned and ready to use. Cooking for a crowd? This is the pan for you. When you pair its naturally seasoned cooking surface with great edges and high walls, there’s no limit to what you can make. Crafted in America with iron and oil, this pan will never dent, bend, or warp so you can serve memories for generations. It provides excellent heat distribution and retention for consistent, even cooking. Seasoned and ready to use. Say goodbye to thumbprints in your dough and hello to easy lifting around the kitchen. Crafted in America with iron and oil, the loaf pan's naturally seasoned baking surface won't dent, bend, or warp at high temperatures. The even heating of cast iron helps you achieve the perfect crust and get well-defined edge pieces. Use this loaf pan to help you bake delectable creations in the kitchen. It provides excellent heat distribution and retention for consistent, even baking. Seasoned and ready to use. Get muffins hot out of the oven with a lovely crust when you use the Cast Iron Muffin Pan. This redesigned version of our muffin pan delivers excellent heat distribution and retention for consistent, even baking, now in a standard size. Seasoned and ready to use for an easy-release finish. Get a secure hold on your Lodge Bakeware with these Silicone Grips. Made to snap on and off the new handle design on all bakeware pieces, these grips fit like a glove (or a hug), giving you a secure grip as you move your piece around the kitchen. Easily remove them for cleaning and high-temp cooking, and use them to carry your hot baked good directly to the table for a colorful presentation.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81emlBfz+BL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Lodge","source_asin":"B0BFRXD5R3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-543673","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BFRXD5R3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BFRXD5R3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":543674,"name":"ZWILLING Fresh & Save 3-pc Vacuum Wine Sealer, Gift Set","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":21.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71W3sLXmqIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Fresh & Save wine sealer is designed to work with the vacuum pump so you can keep open bottles of wine fresh for longer. The sealer works by slowing down the oxidation process, to preserve the aromas of the wine, making it taste better even days after it's uncorked. Produced in high-quality stainless steel, the stylish, dishwasher-safe stopper is a cinch to clean.Here's how it works: Dock the vacuum pump onto the wine sealer and at the push of a button it extracts the air from the bottle in mere seconds. It stops automatically once a sufficient vacuum has been obtained, locking in the aromas and bouquet.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71W3sLXmqIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ZWILLING","source_asin":"B084H12NQ6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-543674","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B084H12NQ6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B084H12NQ6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
