window.products.push({"id":543688,"name":"Silver Fish Jianzhan Tea Cup, Beautiful 3D Chinese Kungfu Teacups Handicrafts Tenmoku Glaze Ceramic Tea Cup (Jianzhan Sliver Fish Cup)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71b6Jesu9qL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"【Chinese Kung Fu Tea Cup】Tea culture has a long history in China. Gongfu tea is a Chinese folk custom of tea tasting. A set of exquisite tea sets with three excellent colors, aromas and tastes complement each other. 【Silver Fish Tea Cup】The bottom of the ceramic teacup is inlaid with a silver fish, which is very lifelike. After pouring tea, it looks more gorgeous and noble. you will feel physically and mentally happy when taste tea using by it. 【Ceramic Jianzhan Tea Cup】Jianzhan teacup has always been a treasure sought after by celebrities at all costs. Its unique charm is that although the world porcelain can create exquisite works of art through the superb skills of skilled craftsmen on the glaze, shape, and pattern, the glaze markings of Jianzhan are a wonderful encounter between \"heavenly craftsmanship\" and \"human skill\". , Which is the so-called \"one color in the kiln, and 10,000 colors out of the kiln\". 【Tenmoku Teacup】Tenmoku teacup has a unique shape, quaint and vivid style. Its raw material ceramics contain less iron. In the tea culture of China and Japan, Tenmu teacup is the most advanced tea bowl. 【Handmade Master Tea Cup】Our silver fish teacup is made of high-end black porcelain clay after high-temperature calcination, hand-inlaid and other 17 complicated techniques. Hope everyone can use it and like it.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71b6Jesu9qL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CmengAo","source_asin":"B09PDKXS2C","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-543688","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09PDKXS2C","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09PDKXS2C","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
