window.products.push({"id":543697,"name":"LR Home Ox Bay Ella Denim Blue Paisley Flatweave Organic Cotton Ottoman Pouf","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":65.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91mN6lf0HfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This charming, round pouf is a versatile and stylish piece that will enhance any room in your home. Handmade in India using 100% cotton, it features a unique and eye-catching pattern that adds character and appeal. Filled with EPS balls, it also provides the perfect balance of support and comfort, making it ideal for use as a seat or a footrest. Its high-quality materials and superior construction ensure that this decorative pouf will last for years to come.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91mN6lf0HfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Lr Home","source_asin":"B08N8KPHS5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-543697","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08N8KPHS5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08N8KPHS5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
