window.products.push({"id":543746,"name":"10 Piece Set Measuring Cups Spoons for Accurate Allocating Dry and Liquid Ingredients, Cooking Baking Measuring Tools, Stainless Steel Measuring Cups ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61vVTV5ayOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"What is a measuring cup and what do I use it for? A measuring cup is a kitchen aid for accurately measuring small quantities when cooking or baking. Such a spoon can be used in many ways - usually for dosing powder, spices, liquids or medicines.  Foods for which a measuring cup is suitable are, for example, baking powder, vanilla sugar, protein powder, coffee and spices such as salt, pepper or herbs. In addition, you can easily add small amounts of liquid such as water, milk, oil or alcohol spoonwise.  Product specification:  Product description: Set of 5 measuring cups and 5 measuring spoons  Material: stainless steel + siliconeApplication: Dry and liquid ingredientsCapacity:  Cups: 1 cup (250 ml), 1/2 cup (125 ml), 1/3 cup (80 ml), 1/4 cup (60 ml), 1/8 cup 30ml Spoons: 1 tbsp:15ml, 1/2 tbsp:7.5ml, 1/3 tsp:5ml, 1/4 tsp:2.5ml, 1/8 tsp:1.25mlDelivery content: 5 measuring cups  5 measuring spoons  2 snap-open rings","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61vVTV5ayOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SZDPC","source_asin":"B088ZT735Y","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-543746","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B088ZT735Y","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B088ZT735Y","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":543747,"name":"Japanese Tea Set, Black Porcelain Tea Set with 1 Teapot Set, 6 Tea Cups,Tea Maker,Beautiful Asian Tea Set for Adults, Tea Lover/Women/Men for Travel,H","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81X4SfTr0QL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Special Tea Set Design 】Tired of \"just brewing and pouring\" your lovely tea in the same way? Let's try this unique Chinese tea set and find out extra leisure from it. Unlike common teapot set in market, this teapot set defines a new look of kungfu tea sets for adults. As a lazy tea set, enjoy a mixed spiritual sense of gongfu and tea and a special experience tea time with friends 【Good Meaning Teapot Set】The appearance of the teapot is the shape of a persimmon, representing the joy of harvest. Means that everything is as it should be, good things are always there. At the same time, its appearance also looks like a pumpkin, pumpkin represents the mature fruit, with good luck and happiness, the meaning of good company, pumpkin lights on Halloween is a symbol of exorcism to avoid ghosts and festivals 【Press The Tea Out】This tea set using the siphon principle, gently press the top, the liquid will flow from the side with high pressure to the side with low pressure. Press until the tea flows out, you can slowly release your hand, so that the teapot and the branch back to the original position, the tea flows out automatically. Using pressure and inertia of the water, say goodbye to the tedious tea brewing procedures 【Realistic Modeling】The teapot base is designed in the shape of a tree trunk, the indentation on the top of the base coincides with the teapot and can be placed smoothly on the base to make tea. The width and height are 4.13 in, better stability, the bottom is flat, the brushed kiln process has clear lines. After high temperature firing, smooth glaze, smooth lines, giving a natural sense of beauty in the visual sense 【Portable Gift Package】This kungfu tea set for adults outer packaging is a blue high-grade leather case with a handle more lightweight to carry.The leather case 15.35*10.24*4.33 in, the front of the case is a gold teapot-shaped \"blessing\", meaning peace and prosperity, is Christmas, Mother's Day, Father's Day, wedding It is the first choice for Christmas, Mother's Day, Father's Day, wedding, birthday gift","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81X4SfTr0QL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Jotboom","source_asin":"B09D7DZSZG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-543747","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09D7DZSZG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09D7DZSZG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
