window.products.push({"id":543756,"name":"HOME MOST 2-Pack Large Display Kitchen Timer - 3\" Digital Timer Magnetic Back Loud Alarm - White Cooking Timers for Kitchen Teachers Students Games Me","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/617qxTOqX1S._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"LARGE Display & BIG Digits & LOUD Alarm & SLEEK Design 1. Three desirable features as a handy kitchen timer: Large LCD Display (3\" screen); Big Digits (1.5\" bold fonts); Loud Beeper Alarm (loud and clear but not deafening).2. The Sleek Design outlook competitors: 3 big no show function buttons on the front bulge of the battery case, leaving more space for LCD screen and looking much nicer than ugly buttons-on competitors; matte white exterior textures well with your kitchen, bedroom, office, etc. COUNT DOWN OR UP & ONE-THUMBED OPERATION & VISION FRIENDLY 1. Can both count down as a timer and count up as a stopwatch in a range from 1 second to 99 minutes.2. 3 big no show function buttons aligned on the front bulge allow simple and reliable one-thumbed operation, no frills features.3. Ever-on technology consumes almost no power while the timer stands by not in use, no need for switching it off.4. Two separate digital timings: MINUTE in larger display; SECOND in large display, easy to read. SLEEK DESIGN AS A VERSATILE TIMER 1. Designed not to be just an ugly kitchen utensil, Home Most timer looks much nicer than competitors so that you want to use it in many other occasions.2. 3 big no show function buttons seamlessly aligned on the front bulge for one-thumbed simple controls, outlooking those ugly buttons-wearing competitors.3. The matte white exterior textures well with your kitchen, bedroom, office, etc. for meetings, homework, exercise, meditation sessions, games, laboratory, etc. FAQs 1. The kitchen timer alarm will sound for 1 minute.2. Countup means the timer acts like a stopwatch, you press start and it will count upward from zero; Countdown is when you set the time and the timer will count down to zero. ATTENTION 1. Please press M, S, or START/STOP to end the alarm.2. Long Press M or S for FAST FORWARD.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/617qxTOqX1S._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HOME MOST","source_asin":"B07GZMNBPN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-543756","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07GZMNBPN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07GZMNBPN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
