window.products.push({"id":543758,"name":"CozyRosie Wearable Sherpa Fleece Blanket with Sleeves for Adults Allows You to Button Up and Go - Extra Soft, Warm and Cozy Throw Makes for a Great Gi","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/816ngUcsZFS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Polyester Sherpa UNLIKE ANY OTHER - BUTTON UP AND GO: Enjoy the newly designed throw blanket from CozyRosie - This is not your typical blanket, oh no it isn't! Not only does this one have a thick sherpa lining that will keep you feeling warm and fuzzy, but it is also the only one that has buttons that will allow you to WRAP YOURSELF WHILE WALKING and EVEN ROLL UP YOUR SLEEVES! CozyRosie - THE GRANDMA THAT CARES: Born out of love, CozyRosie represents all the love and warmth in the household. As such, CozyRosie blankets are made to bring joy and warm feelings of comfort to your home. Use our products anywhere in the house - the couch, sofa, or bed! OPERATION WARM: With our new partnership a portion of your purchase goes to Operation Warm, an amazing organization that creates brand new, high-quality coats for children in need, offering a child both physical and emotional warmth. A GIFT SURE TO MAKE THEM SMILE: This Christmas put a smile on their face with a luxury plush sleeved blanket. After all, who wouldn't love a soft warm hug in the wintertime? As comfortable as it is cute, these lightweight blankets are sure to be the gift of the year! LIFETIME PROMISE: If for any reason you aren't happy with your purchase, don't hesitate to reach out and we will be happy to take care of you! Imagine…. You are comfortably laying on your couch in your favorite place in the world, home. It’s been a long week and you can finally take a breath of relief. Wrapped around you is the softest blanket you’ve ever touched and its warm embrace is everything that this moment of relaxation could ever ask for. CozyRosie Wearable Sherpa Blanket is all you need to create the feeling of comfort and warmth wherever you are.  With our new Button Up and Go design, we bring you the first wearable blanket that you can walk around in, that doesn’t look like a hospital gown and won’t slip off. That means you can stay just as warm","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/816ngUcsZFS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CozyRosie","source_asin":"B07WVVBHZR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-543758","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07WVVBHZR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07WVVBHZR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
