window.products.push({"id":543804,"name":"Kids Play Mat Playroom Rug - 3D City Engineering Rugs Carpet with 8 Two-way Hot Wheels Track, 6 Mini Engineer Pull Back Car Toys and Non-slip Design f","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":49.11,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81HYMhJjqRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🚕FUN CARPET FOR BOYS- VIVID URBAN CONSTRUCTION SCENE! If your little boy like to play construction vehicles or dream of being a engineer, then he will definitely love our kid play mat.This playroom rug are especially designed of great variety urban construction site with buildings,various engineer car displays, such as excavators, dump trucks, cement trucks, road rollers, cranes, tractors, mixers, etc. Also With 8 two-way driving road, lots of places on the rug to for the car to drive to. 🚕67'' X 35'' EXTRA LARGE GAME CARPET AND EASY TO CLEAN. Our jumbo kids play rug features driving roads, traffic crossings and intersections that are perfect for 2 -5 kids to play together, enjoy the happy fun time and improve kids social skill. This carpet are easy to clean with vacuum. 🚕3D EFFECT CITY BUILDINGS & REALISTIC ENGINEERING CARS. Become the engineer manager of your town! Children can drive around the city to various construction sites and follow up the progress of each site. There are lots of realistic city buildings and vehicles on the play mat and they all have 3D effect, vivid image and bright color, lost of fun for kids play on the mat. 🚕INCLUDES 6PCS ALLOY PULL-BACK CAR FOR ROLLING ON THE PLAYROOM RUG. Our floor mat also contains 6 styles construction vehicles like excavator, bulldozer, loading car and pile driver, which are made of aluminum alloy, durable and reusable. Kids will love to run his car on the road and point our the name of the buildings and engineering vehicle in the map. Engaging activity rug stimulating imaginative play for kids. 🚕HIGH QUALITY AND CHILD-FRIENDLY RUG. Our kids car mat is made of high quality crystal velvet, wear-resistant and healthy, rubber backed for non - slip design with stitched edging and exquisite workmanship. Perfect Decor for toddlers boys kids room, playroom and bedroom.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81HYMhJjqRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PartyKindom","source_asin":"B08QMNWHJC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-543804","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08QMNWHJC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08QMNWHJC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
