window.products.push({"id":543811,"name":"Bath Bed Decor Set of 2 Throw Pillow Case Soft Decorative Square Cushion Cover for Couch 100% Cotton Square Euro Pillow Shams With Invisible Zipper Sw","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71qQOr72pvL._AC_SL1181_.jpg","description":"Brand : Bath Bed Decor Box Contains : 2 Piece Cushion Cover / Shell only. Cushions are not included. Carefully hand finished with a fantabulous quality Cushion Cover will add a great accent to your living room, lounge or bedroom. PRODUCT FEATURES 1. Each Throw Pillow Cover is made of 100% cotton canvas for increased sturdiness 2. Each Cushion Cover has a high quality hidden/concealed zipper, that allows for easy insertion and removal of pillow inserts  3. Pillow Covers edges are stitched with overlock stitches to avoid fray and increase the strength of cushion covers 4. These throw pillow cases are suitable for use in sofa/couch & beds 5. Fully machine washable, we recommend following the care instructions provided on the Wash Care label GOOD TO KNOW BEFORE YOU BUY 1. Due to differences in color variances settings between each Computer, Laptop, Phone or Tablet the actual product might have a minor color difference to the picture on screen. 2. As each product is completely handmade, there may be minor size variation ( + or - 0.5 cm ) CHOOSING THE RIGHT PILLOW COVERS (OR) PILLOWS 1. Measure 2 adjacent sides of existing cushions. This will give the size of the pillow cover to choose. E.g. if the pillow is 18 x 18 Inch on the sides, then the pillow cover to choose is 18 x 18 Inch. 2. If buying new pillows, then a) Choose either the same size pillows as the pillow covers (e.g., 18x18 Inch Cover = 18x18 Inch Pillow) (OR) b) Choose up to a maximum of 2 inches bigger pillows than the pillow covers to get a full and fluffy pillow.(e.g., 18x18 Inch Cover = Up to 20x20 Inch Pillow) About Bath Bed Decor We are zealous about providing the finest quality products at a reasonable price for every home.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71qQOr72pvL._AC_SL1181_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bath Bed Decor","source_asin":"B071VNQP41","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-543811","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B071VNQP41","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B071VNQP41","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
