window.products.push({"id":543929,"name":"The Ballow Knot Pillow - Boucle Fabric Large Knot Pillow Decorative Knotted Ball Pillow - Round Throw Pillows for Couch or Cuddle Pillow - (Indigo)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":45.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/815ZqsvXAkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"FYI For ease of shipping, The Ballow Knot comes in a vacuum packed bag. Simply fluff and mold it back to shape by tugging on each tube. After a week or so, the filling will naturally expand to that ball shape. :) The Ballow Knot by Hooga HomeThis playful knot pillow is the knotty sibling of Hooga Home's original ball pillow, The Ballow. With its never ending curves and cozy fabric, The Ballow Knot adds warmth and texture to your home decor. Plus, these knotted decorative throw pillows look wonderful paired up with throw pillows of other shapes and sizes! High Quality Materials The Ballow Knot is covered in a super soft and cozy teddy fabric. Our teddy cover is thicker and more durable than most, and has low liquid absorption, making it more stain resistant. On the inside, It's stuffed with a high weight recycled polyester fill that has provides structure to your knot pillow. Not to worry, your cushion won't be too firm. It's bouncy and moldable for extra comfort. Easy To Clean Let's face it, if you use these as sofa pillows, a floor pillow, or in other high traffic living areas with kids playing, they're bound to get a little dirty. Simply dab the stain with some warm water and watch it disappear. A Style For Everyone This knotted sphere pillow is like that one friend that can get along with anyone. Pop it in any style room, from eclectic decor, retro vibes, modern decor, boho decor, and even traditional home decor, and it magically fits in. It’s Practical There's so many ways to use a round decorative pillow: chair pillow, couch pillow, bed decor, lumbar throw pillow. Some customers love putting these in a kid's room. It looks super cute and kid's can play with it or use it as a cuddle pillow. It's Gift Ready! Comes with a Hooga canvas bag. Simply pop The Ballow Knot in the bag, and it's ready to gifted. Thank you!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/815ZqsvXAkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Generic","source_asin":"B0BPK4X1H7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-543929","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BPK4X1H7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BPK4X1H7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
