window.products.push({"id":543963,"name":"GREENSTELL Corner Shelves Wall Mounted, Pine Floating Shelves Set of 2 with Hooks and Towel Bar, Rustic Wood Corner Wall Storage Shelves for Bathroom,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71EuqWuUp-S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"MULTI-PURPOSE CORNER SHELF--The unique L shape makes the corner shelf easy to install in the corner of the wall, and can be installed in the corner aisle at the same time. The floating shelf increases the storage space, which is very suitable for installation in the bedroom, living room, kitchen, bathroom and aisle SAVE SPACE--Greenstell's corner shelf has a large capacity, which can be used for storage and display of small objects. The support frame under the corner frame is equipped with 7 hooks and connecting rods. The hooks can be hung with keys, trinkets, earphones, etc. The towel bar of the corner floating rack can be adjusted, which can be adjusted according to your own needs, which is convenient to use WALL DECORATION SHELVES--Greenstell corner floating shelves has a simple style, black frosted industrial metal frame, suitable for any wall decoration, to meet the decoration needs of various rooms. You can place photo frame, books, shampoos, shower gels, etc. on the corner floating shelf, which can be decorated and meet practical needs. The corner floating shelf bears 44LB, which meets your storage function, combining decoration with practicality DOUBLE-LAYER DESIGN AND MULTI-SCENE USE--The longest side and widest side of the corner shelf are 16.5 inches and 11 inches respectively. The double wall corner shelf can fully display your albums, books, toys, etc., while the floating shelf can be installed in the bathroom, study, living room, kitchen and other places, multi-scene and multi-functional use, convenient for your storage EASY TO INSTALL--Greenstell corner floating shelves comes with necessary hardware and instruction. The corner shelves made of solid wood and metal bracket is simple in structure. And we have a good after-sales service, you can consult at any time if you have any questions, we will give you the most satisfactory answer.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71EuqWuUp-S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GREENSTELL","source_asin":"B093RDQNBC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-543963","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B093RDQNBC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B093RDQNBC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":543964,"name":"Dolonm Swivel Accent Barrel Chair Modern Sofa Lounge Club Round Chair Linen Fabric for Living Room Hotel with 3 Pillows (Beige)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":669.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91inQU7Ol5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Comfortable and Durable: The linen covering adds durable to this club chair and the carved back and integrated arms complete its modern look. High quality surface and thick padded inside material, which could give you comfortable and relaxing sitting feeling. 360-Degree Swivel Chair: The Dolonm barrel chair is founded atop a posh 360-degree swivel pedestal base, which allows effortlessly sitting, changing sitting position without moving the base. Superior Construction: This barrel chair is constructed of soft foam-padded seat, strong composite wood frame and upholstered in linen fabric. It sits atop sturdy metal base for high weight capacity up to 300lb. 3 Throw Pillows: The modern leisure chair comes with 3 movable cushions, which can be used not only as a cushion but also as a pillow. Perfect for your nest and you can really enjoy the peaceful and tranquil time of reading or pleasant chatting time. Elegant for Living Room: This chair comes in handy when you require a piece of functional and accent furniture. Perfect addition to the living room, bedroom, guest room, and also serves great in cafés and hotels.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91inQU7Ol5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Dolonm","source_asin":"B08MDCB6D7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-543964","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08MDCB6D7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08MDCB6D7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":543965,"name":"Viking Culinary Hard Anodized Nonstick Dutch Oven, 6 Quart, Includes Glass Lid, Dishwasher, Oven Safe, Works on All Cooktops including Induction","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":119.97,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71UP7JC8llL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Experience even heat and exceptional release with Viking Hard Anodized Nonstick Cookware. Constructed with heavy gauge anodized aluminum for durability and even heat distribution throughout the sides and bottom of the pan, Viking Hard Anodized Cookware features a stainless steel base making it exceptionally stable and compatible with all cooktops including induction. Accepted worldwide as one of the most conductive metals for cooking, the aluminum is strengthened through the anodizing process until it is twice as hard as stainless steel. Each piece is coated with three layers of durable nonstick coating to ensure maximum release and longevity, even when using metal utensils. The multi-layer coating improves release and protection even if the top layer is scratched over time. The fry pans feature flared rims for easy tossing and drip-free pouring, while the sauce pans, saute and Dutch oven feature cut rims to enhance the lid fit, helping keep moisture and nutrients inside the pan during cooking. The saucepans and larger vessels feature interior measurement markings for accurate addition and reduction of ingredients. Tempered glass lids allow you to \"look and cook\" as you watch the progress of your meal. Designed with ergonomics in mind, Viking signature handles are hand crafted from cast stainless steel and riveted to the pan for a lifetime of durability. Lid handles and long handles feature heat breaks to help them stay cool on the cooktop during use. Long handles feature a finger stop that guides your hand to the perfect grip for comfort, balance and control. Viking Hard Anodized cookware can be used on all cooktops, including induction, in the oven, or on the grill up to 500F, making it perfect for finishing dishes the same way a professional chef does. The glass lids are oven safe to 350F. Viking Hard Anodized Nonstick cookware is dishwasher safe and backed by a limited lifetime .","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71UP7JC8llL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Viking Culinary","source_asin":"B073WV4YH4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-543965","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B073WV4YH4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B073WV4YH4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
